Z||000000||Bluemagic||12-25-2001||12:32 PM||||Ihave been working on a subwoofer system for my fiero for about10 months now and I have finally found the kind of bass I was looking for and am now in the process of making it available to the Fiero comunity.I have been doing custom car stereo design and installation for about 15years and have done a lot of award winning cars here in Miami so with this knowledge it sure did help.I do intend to market them in two colors  gray and tan carpeted with ezee speaker connectors as far as cost is we are working on that now so it will be affordable for just about eveyone , I am not looking to get rich by making the prices out of reach .<BR>They can be had with or with out speaker the choice will be yours.<P>------------------<BR>Keith<BR>85 SE Fiero 4.9L Caddy <BR>345hp||||reg||1
